OL,3,GNEWSAThe Cemetery of the Year that's a
OL,4,Awildlife oasis
OL,5,
OL,6,FA peaceful hillside cemetery which
OL,7,Fdates back to 1850 has won a Cemetery
OL,8,Fof the year award.
OL,10,FBridgnorth Cemetery is situated on a
OL,11,Fsite that has been designated as an
OL,12,Farea of Special Scientific Interest, it
OL,13,Fis split between old and new - with
OL,14,Fwartime graves at the bottom, and
OL,15,Fmodern resting places at the top of its
OL,16,Fhill.
OL,18,FAs well as being the home of two
OL,19,Fchapels, one which was built in 1855,
OL,20,Fthere are about 120 species of
OL,21,Fwildflowers and an abundance of
OL,22,Fwildlife.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
